# explainer-each (M11): the other three explainers at rest, the pointer resting on each chip in turn
# (centres (70, 468.5), (70, 529.5), (70, 573.5)): k's (a shift: the anchor carried up 2), b's (a
# scale: the unit point carried right; its sentence's first line 263.79 px in its 266, which Clay's
# own wrap would break early) and h's (the anchor carried right; "x − 2" kept on one line by its
# no-break spaces). Leaving a chip for the next closes one explainer and the rest opens the next.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
move 70 468
wait 1104
shot explainer-k
move 70 529
wait 1104
shot explainer-b
move 70 573
wait 1104
shot explainer-h
